		{
			"id": "shKvFcJ6ISXmDVG-h",
			"name": "Leadership",
			"local_notes": "Lore: Rallying broken troops is a Commissar's central battlefield function.\n\nDesign: IQ+2 (14) for 8 points, Average.",
			"tags": [
				"Imperium"
			],
			"difficulty": "iq/a",
			"points": 8
		},
		{
			"id": "sd7KB9vRiu_f3bTgP",
			"name": "Intimidation",
			"local_notes": "Lore: A Commissar's authority is enforced as much by presence and reputation as by the bolt pistol itself.\n\nDesign: Will+2 (16) for 8 points, Average.",
			"tags": [
				"Imperium"
			],
			"difficulty": "will/a",
			"points": 8
		},
		{
			"id": "sO3MXKQkhNK8cZu_o",
			"name": "Tactics",
			"local_notes": "Lore: Enough grasp of tactics to judge an officer's competence, not merely follow orders.\n\nDesign: IQ+1 (13) for 8 points, Hard.",
			"tags": [
				"Imperium"
			],
			"difficulty": "iq/h",
			"points": 8
		},
		{
			"id": "siH5AsuxwPvMfOd2E",
			"name": "Strategy",
			"local_notes": "Lore: Broader campaign awareness expected of an officer who reports on a regiment's conduct.\n\nDesign: IQ+0 (12) for 4 points, Hard.",
			"tags": [
				"Imperium"
			],
			"difficulty": "iq/h",
			"points": 4
		},
		{
			"id": "scurIy2_FQSrpDuyR",
			"name": "Public Speaking",
			"local_notes": "Lore: Addressing a regiment before battle, or reading a sentence of execution, are both public performances.\n\nDesign: IQ+1 (13) for 4 points, Average.",
			"tags": [
				"Imperium"
			],
			"difficulty": "iq/a",
			"points": 4
		},
		{
			"id": "sskkiT_a-30BeKDie",
			"name": "Law",
			"local_notes": "Lore: A Commissar's summary judgments still draw on the Lex Imperialis' framework, however abbreviated the process.\n\nDesign: IQ+0 (12) for 4 points, Hard.",
			"tags": [
				"Imperium"
			],
			"specialization": "Imperial",
			"difficulty": "iq/h",
			"points": 4
		},
		{
			"id": "sqI_NgzhefJwzy9Y4",
			"name": "Savoir-Faire",
			"local_notes": "Lore: Officer-level military etiquette.\n\nDesign: IQ+0 (12) for 1 point, Easy.",
			"tags": [
				"Imperium"
			],
			"specialization": "Military",
